# ==============================================================================
# Database: DNS Query Pattern Fingerprints (OS & Core Ecosystem)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Field Schema:
#   Regex FQDN | OS / Core Service Name | Confidence Score (1-99) | Device Type | Vendor
#
# Rules for Adding Entries:
#   1. Confidence Tiers:
#      - 90-99: Core OS telemetry & update CDNs (e.g. msftncsi, mesu.apple.com).
#      - 60-85: Dedicated ecosystem infrastructure (e.g. miui, smartthings).
#      - 30-55: Multi-platform services, portals, web clients.
#   2. Specific subdomains MUST precede parent root domains.
#   3. Linux distribution repos must use 'server' or 'pc' as Device Type (NEVER 'Windows').
#
# Example:
#   dns\.msftncsi\.com|Windows|96|pc|Microsoft
#   deb\.debian\.org|Linux (Debian)|95|server|Debian
# ==============================================================================

